#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:728
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Enabling Additional Application Features"
msgstr "启用其他应用程序功能"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:733
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some applications define additional features in their [.filename]#Cargo."
"toml#.  They can be compiled in by setting `CARGO_FEATURES` in the port."
msgstr "某些应用程序会在其 [.filename]#Cargo.toml# 中定义其他功能。可以在 port 中设置 `CARGO_FEATURES` 来编译这些功能。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:735
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here we enable Tokei's `json` and `yaml` features:"
msgstr "这里启用 Tokei 的 `json` 和 `yaml` 功能："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:739
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "CARGO_FEATURES=\tjson yaml\n"
msgstr "CARGO_FEATURES=\tjson yaml\n"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:744
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Encoding Application Features As Port Options"
msgstr "将应用程序功能设为 Port 选项"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:748
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An example `[features]` section in [.filename]#Cargo.toml# could look like "
"this:"
msgstr "[.filename]#Cargo.toml# 中的 `[features]` 部分示例如下："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:755
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[features]\n"
"pulseaudio_backend = [\"librespot-playback/pulseaudio-backend\"]\n"
"portaudio_backend = [\"librespot-playback/portaudio-backend\"]\n"
"default = [\"pulseaudio_backend\"]\n"
msgstr "[features]\npulseaudio_backend = [\"librespot-playback/pulseaudio-backend\"]\nportaudio_backend = [\"librespot-playback/portaudio-backend\"]\ndefault = [\"pulseaudio_backend\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:760
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`pulseaudio_backend` is a default feature.  It is always enabled unless we "
"explicitly turn off default features by adding `--no-default-features` to "
"`CARGO_FEATURES`.  Here we turn the `portaudio_backend` and "
"`pulseaudio_backend` features into port options:"
msgstr "`pulseaudio_backend` 是默认功能。除非通过在 `CARGO_FEATURES` 中添加 `--no-default-features` 明确关闭默认功能，否则它始终处于启用状态。这里将 `portaudio_backend` 和 `pulseaudio_backend` 功能转换为 port 选项："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:764
