#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:971
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Setting Output Binary Name or Installation Path"
msgstr "设置输出二进制文件名或安装路径"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:976
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some ports need to install the resulting binary under a different name or to "
"a path other than the default `${PREFIX}/bin`.  This can be done by using "
"`GO_TARGET` tuple syntax, for example:"
msgstr "有些 port 需要以不同名称或安装到默认 `${PREFIX}/bin` 之外的路径。可以使用 `GO_TARGET` 元组语法实现，例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:980
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "GO_TARGET=  ./cmd/ipfs:ipfs-go\n"
msgstr "GO_TARGET=  ./cmd/ipfs:ipfs-go\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:983
#, fuzzy
msgid "will install `ipfs` binary as `${PREFIX}/bin/ipfs-go` and"
msgstr "会将 `ipfs` 二进制文件安装为 `${PREFIX}/bin/ipfs-go`，而"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:987
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "GO_TARGET=  ./dnscrypt-proxy:${PREFIX}/sbin/dnscrypt-proxy\n"
msgstr "GO_TARGET=  ./dnscrypt-proxy:${PREFIX}/sbin/dnscrypt-proxy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:990
#, fuzzy
msgid "will install `dnscrypt-proxy` to `${PREFIX}/sbin`."
msgstr "会将 `dnscrypt-proxy` 安装到 `${PREFIX}/sbin`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:993
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Overriding go.mod in Modules Mode"
msgstr "在 Modules 模式下覆盖 go.mod"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:998
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"During the fetch phase, modules-aware mode (that is, `USES=go:modules`) "
"obtains sources for dependent packages by fetching the port's [.filename]#go."
"mod# and then immediately running `go mod download` against it.  Because the "
"fetch phase occurs long before patching, regular patches in [."
"filename]#files/# are applied far too late to affect those dependency "
"resolution and fetch steps."
msgstr "在获取阶段，支持模块的模式（即 `USES=go:modules`）会获取 port 的 [.filename]#go.mod#，然后立即对其运行 `go mod download`，以获取依赖包的源代码。由于获取阶段远早于打补丁阶段，在 [.filename]#files/# 中的常规补丁要到很晚才会应用，无法影响这些依赖项的解析和获取步骤。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1000
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While patching the upstream [.filename]#go.mod# to alter dependencies isn't "
"possible at this time, you can still *override* it by listing another [."
"filename]#go.mod# as a second distfile."
msgstr "目前无法通过打补丁修改上游的 [.filename]#go.mod#，但仍可通过将另一个 [.filename]#go.mod# 列为第二个 distfile 来进行*覆盖*。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1008
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tmiller\n"
"DISTVERSIONPREFIX=\tv\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t6.17.0\n"
"CATEGORIES=\ttextproc\n"
"MASTER_SITES=\thttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/johnkerl/${PORTNAME}/${DISTVERSIONFULL}/:gomod\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tmiller\nDISTVERSIONPREFIX=\tv\nDISTVERSION=\t6.17.0\nCATEGORIES=\ttextproc\nMASTER_SITES=\thttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/johnkerl/${PORTNAME}/${DISTVERSIONFULL}/:gomod\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1010
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "DISTFILES=\tgo.mod:gomod\n"
msgstr "DISTFILES=\tgo.mod:gomod\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1013
#, fuzzy
msgid "To override [.filename]#go.sum# as well, just add it to `DISTFILES`:"
msgstr "如需同时覆盖 [.filename]#go.sum#，只需将它也添加到 `DISTFILES`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1017
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "DISTFILES=\tgo.mod:gomod go.sum:gomod\n"
msgstr "DISTFILES=\tgo.mod:gomod go.sum:gomod\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1021
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Building Haskell Applications with `cabal`"
msgstr "使用 `cabal` 构建 Haskell 应用程序"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1025
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For ports that use Cabal, build system defines `USES=cabal`.  Refer to "
"crossref:uses[uses-cabal,`cabal`] for a list of variables that can be set to "
"control the build process."
msgstr "对于使用 Cabal 的 port，构建系统定义了 `USES=cabal`。有关可设置以控制构建过程的变量列表，请参阅 crossref:uses[uses-cabal,`cabal`]。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1027
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Creating a Port for a Hackage-hosted Haskell Application"
msgstr "为托管在 Hackage 上的 Haskell 应用程序创建 Port"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1032
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When preparing a Haskell Cabal port, package:devel/hs-cabal-install[] and "
"package:ports-mgmt/hs-cabal2tuple[] programs are required, so make sure they "
"are installed beforehand.  First we need to define common ports variables "
"that allow cabal-install to fetch the package distribution file:"
msgstr "准备 Haskell Cabal port 时，需要使用 package:devel/hs-cabal-install[] 和 package:ports-mgmt/hs-cabal2tuple[] 程序，因此请确保事先安装它们。首先，我们需要定义一些通用的 ports 变量，以便 cabal-install 获取软件包发行文件："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1038
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tShellCheck\n"
"DISTVERSION=\t0.6.0\n"
"CATEGORIES=\tdevel\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tShellCheck\nDISTVERSION=\t0.6.0\nCATEGORIES=\tdevel\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1042
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"MAINTAINER=\thaskell@FreeBSD.org\n"
"COMMENT=\tShell script analysis tool\n"
"WWW=\t\thttps://www.shellcheck.net/\n"
msgstr "MAINTAINER=\thaskell@FreeBSD.org\nCOMMENT=\tShell script analysis tool\nWWW=\t\thttps://www.shellcheck.net/\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1044
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1127
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "USES=\t\tcabal\n"
msgstr "USES=\t\tcabal\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1049
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This minimal Makefile fetches the distribution file with the `cabal-extract` "
"helper target:"
msgstr "这个最简 Makefile 使用 `cabal-extract` 辅助目标获取发行文件："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1059
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% make cabal-extract\n"
"[...]\n"
"Downloading the latest package list from hackage.haskell.org\n"
"cabal get ShellCheck-0.6.0\n"
"Downloading  ShellCheck-0.6.0\n"
"Downloaded   ShellCheck-0.6.0\n"
"Unpacking to ShellCheck-0.6.0/\n"
msgstr "% make cabal-extract\n[...]\nDownloading the latest package list from hackage.haskell.org\ncabal get ShellCheck-0.6.0\nDownloading  ShellCheck-0.6.0\nDownloaded   ShellCheck-0.6.0\nUnpacking to ShellCheck-0.6.0/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1062
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now that we have ShellCheck.cabal package description file under `${WRKSRC}"
"`, we can use `cabal-configure` to generate the build plan:"
msgstr "现在 `${WRKSRC}` 下有了 ShellCheck.cabal 软件包描述文件，可以使用 `cabal-configure` 生成构建计划："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1073
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% make cabal-configure\n"
"[...]\n"
"Resolving dependencies...\n"
"Build profile: -w ghc-8.10.7 -O1\n"
"In order, the following would be built (use -v for more details):\n"
" - Diff-0.4.1 (lib) (requires download & build)\n"
" - OneTuple-0.3.1 (lib) (requires download & build)\n"
"[...]\n"
msgstr "% make cabal-configure\n[...]\nResolving dependencies...\nBuild profile: -w ghc-8.10.7 -O1\nIn order, the following would be built (use -v for more details):\n - Diff-0.4.1 (lib) (requires download & build)\n - OneTuple-0.3.1 (lib) (requires download & build)\n[...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1076
#, fuzzy
msgid "Once done, a list of required dependencies can generated:"
msgstr "完成后，可以生成所需依赖项列表："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1084
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% make make-use-cabal\n"
"USE_CABAL=\tQuickCheck-2.12.6.1 \\\n"
"\t\thashable-1.3.0.0 \\\n"
"\t\tinteger-logarithms-1.0.3 \\\n"
"[...]\n"
msgstr "% make make-use-cabal\nUSE_CABAL=\tQuickCheck-2.12.6.1 \\\n\t\thashable-1.3.0.0 \\\n\t\tinteger-logarithms-1.0.3 \\\n[...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1090
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Haskell packages may contain revisions, just like FreeBSD ports.  Revisions "
"can affect [.filename]#.cabal# files only.  Note additional version numbers "
"after the `_` symbol.  Put newly generated `USE_CABAL` list instead of an "
"old one."
msgstr "Haskell 软件包可能包含修订版本，与 FreeBSD ports 一样。修订版本只会影响 [.filename]#.cabal# 文件。请注意 `_` 符号后面的其他版本号。使用新生成的 `USE_CABAL` 列表替换旧列表。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1092
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Finally, [.filename]#distinfo# needs to be regenerated to contain all the "
"distribution files:"
msgstr "最后，需要重新生成 [.filename]#distinfo#，以包含所有发行文件："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1103
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% make makesum\n"
"=> ShellCheck-0.6.0.tar.gz doesn't seem to exist in /usr/local/poudriere/ports/git/distfiles/cabal.\n"
"=> Attempting to fetch https://hackage.haskell.org/package/ShellCheck-0.6.0/ShellCheck-0.6.0.tar.gz\n"
"ShellCheck-0.6.0.tar.gz                                136 kB  642 kBps    00s\n"
"=> QuickCheck-2.12.6.1/QuickCheck-2.12.6.1.tar.gz doesn't seem to exist in /usr/local/poudriere/ports/git/distfiles/cabal.\n"
"=> Attempting to fetch https://hackage.haskell.org/package/QuickCheck-2.12.6.1/QuickCheck-2.12.6.1.tar.gz\n"
"QuickCheck-2.12.6.1/QuickCheck-2.12.6.1.tar.gz          65 kB  361 kBps    00s\n"
"[...]\n"
msgstr "% make makesum\n=> ShellCheck-0.6.0.tar.gz doesn't seem to exist in /usr/local/poudriere/ports/git/distfiles/cabal.\n=> Attempting to fetch https://hackage.haskell.org/package/ShellCheck-0.6.0/ShellCheck-0.6.0.tar.gz\nShellCheck-0.6.0.tar.gz                                136 kB  642 kBps    00s\n=> QuickCheck-2.12.6.1/QuickCheck-2.12.6.1.tar.gz doesn't seem to exist in /usr/local/poudriere/ports/git/distfiles/cabal.\n=> Attempting to fetch https://hackage.haskell.org/package/QuickCheck-2.12.6.1/QuickCheck-2.12.6.1.tar.gz\nQuickCheck-2.12.6.1/QuickCheck-2.12.6.1.tar.gz          65 kB  361 kBps    00s\n[...]\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1113
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some Haskell ports install various data files under `share/${PORTNAME}`. For "
"such cases special handling is required on the port side.  The port should "
"define the `CABAL_WRAPPER_SCRIPTS` knob listing each executable that is "
"going to use data files. Moreover, in rare cases the program being ported "
"uses data files of other Haskell packages, in which case the "
"`FOO_DATADIR_VARS` comes to the rescue."
msgstr "有些 Haskell port 会在 `share/${PORTNAME}` 下安装各种数据文件。这种情况下，需要在 port 端进行特殊处理。port 应定义 `CABAL_WRAPPER_SCRIPTS` 参数，列出所有将使用数据文件的可执行文件。此外，在少数情况下，正在移植的程序会使用其他 Haskell 软件包的数据文件，此时可以使用 `FOO_DATADIR_VARS` 解决。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1115
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Handling Data Files in a Haskell Port"
msgstr "处理 Haskell Port 中的数据文件"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1119
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`devel/hs-profiteur` is a Haskell application that generates a single-page "
"HTML with some content."
msgstr "`devel/hs-profiteur` 是一个 Haskell 应用程序，可生成包含一些内容的单页 HTML。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1123
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "PORTNAME=\tprofiteur\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tprofiteur\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1125
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1140
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1158
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "[...]\n"
msgstr "[...]\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1131
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1144
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USE_CABAL=\tOneTuple-0.3.1_2 \\\n"
"\t\tQuickCheck-2.14.2 \\\n"
"\t\t[...]\n"
msgstr "USE_CABAL=\tOneTuple-0.3.1_2 \\\n\t\tQuickCheck-2.14.2 \\\n\t\t[...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1136
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It installs HTML templates under `share/profiteur`, so we need to add "
"`CABAL_WRAPPER_SCRIPTS` knob:"
msgstr "它会在 `share/profiteur` 下安装 HTML 模板，因此我们需要添加 `CABAL_WRAPPER_SCRIPTS` 参数："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1147
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "CABAL_WRAPPER_SCRIPTS=\t\t${CABAL_EXECUTABLES}\n"
msgstr "CABAL_WRAPPER_SCRIPTS=\t\t${CABAL_EXECUTABLES}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1154
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The program also tries to access the `jquery.js` file, which is a part of "
"`js-jquery-3.3.1` Haskell package.  For that file to be found, we need to "
"make the wrapper script to look for `js-jquery` data files in `share/"
"profiteur` too.  We use `profiteur_DATADIR_VARS` for this:"
msgstr "该程序还会尝试访问 `jquery.js` 文件，它属于 Haskell 软件包 `js-jquery-3.3.1`。为了找到该文件，我们需要让包装脚本也在 `share/profiteur` 中查找 `js-jquery` 数据文件。为此，我们使用 `profiteur_DATADIR_VARS`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1161
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"CABAL_WRAPPER_SCRIPTS=\t\t${CABAL_EXECUTABLES}\n"
"profiteur_DATADIR_VARS=\t\tjs-jquery\n"
msgstr "CABAL_WRAPPER_SCRIPTS=\t\t${CABAL_EXECUTABLES}\nprofiteur_DATADIR_VARS=\t\tjs-jquery\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1166
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now the port will install the actual binary into `libexec/cabal/profiteur` "
"and the script into `bin/profiteur`."
msgstr "现在，该 port 将把实际的二进制文件安装到 `libexec/cabal/profiteur`，并将脚本安装到 `bin/profiteur`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1171
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There is no easy way to find out a proper value for the `FOO_DATADIR_VARS` "
"knob apart from running the program and checking that everything works.  "
"Luckily, the need to use `FOO_DATADIR_VARS` is very rare."
msgstr "除了运行程序并检查一切是否正常外，没有简单的方法可以确定 `FOO_DATADIR_VARS` 参数的合适值。幸运的是，极少需要使用 `FOO_DATADIR_VARS`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1173
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Another corner case when porting complex Haskell programs is the presence of "
"VCS dependencies in the `cabal.project` file."
msgstr "移植复杂 Haskell 程序时的另一个特殊情况，是 `cabal.project` 文件中存在 VCS 依赖项。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1175
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Porting Haskell Applications with VCS Dependencies"
msgstr "移植含有 VCS 依赖项的 Haskell 应用程序"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1180
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`net-p2p/cardano-node` is an extremely complex piece of software. In its "
"`cabal.project` there are a lot of blocks like this:"
msgstr "`net-p2p/cardano-node` 是一款极其复杂的软件。在它的 `cabal.project` 文件中，有许多类似这样的代码块："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1189
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[...]\n"
"source-repository-package\n"
"  type: git\n"
"  location: https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-crypto\n"
"  tag: f73079303f663e028288f9f4a9e08bcca39a923e\n"
"[...]\n"
msgstr "[...]\nsource-repository-package\n  type: git\n  location: https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-crypto\n  tag: f73079303f663e028288f9f4a9e08bcca39a923e\n[...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1195
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Dependencies of type `source-repository-package` are automatically pulled in "
"by `cabal` during the build process.  Unfortunately, this makes use of the "
"network after the `fetch` stage. This is disallowed by the ports framework.  "
"These sources need to be listed in the port's Makefile. The `make-use-cabal` "
"helper target can make it easy for packages hosted on GitHub.  Running this "
"target after the usual `cabal-extract` and `cabal-configure` will produce "
"not only the `USE_CABAL` knob, but also `GH_TUPLE`:"
msgstr "`cabal` 会在构建过程中自动提取 `source-repository-package` 类型的依赖项。不幸的是，这会在 `fetch` 阶段之后访问网络，而 ports 框架不允许这样做。这些源代码必须列在 port 的 Makefile 中。对于托管在 GitHub 上的软件包，`make-use-cabal` 辅助目标可以简化这一工作。在常规的 `cabal-extract` 和 `cabal-configure` 之后运行此目标，不仅会生成 `USE_CABAL` 参数，还会生成 `GH_TUPLE`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1203
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% make make-use-cabal\n"
"USE_CABAL=\tDiff-0.4.1 \\\n"
"\t\tGlob-0.10.2_3 \\\n"
"\t\tHUnit-1.6.2.0 \\\n"
"\t\t[...]\n"
msgstr "% make make-use-cabal\nUSE_CABAL=\tDiff-0.4.1 \\\n\t\tGlob-0.10.2_3 \\\n\t\tHUnit-1.6.2.0 \\\n\t\t[...]\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1207
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GH_TUPLE=\t\tinput-output-hk:cardano-base:0f3a867493059e650cda69e20a5cbf1ace289a57:cardano_base/dist-newstyle/src/cardano-b_-c8db9876882556ed \\\n"
"\t\tinput-output-hk:cardano-crypto:f73079303f663e028288f9f4a9e08bcca39a923e:cardano_crypto/dist-newstyle/src/cardano-c_-253fd88117badd8f \\\n"
"\t\t[...]\n"
msgstr "GH_TUPLE=\t\tinput-output-hk:cardano-base:0f3a867493059e650cda69e20a5cbf1ace289a57:cardano_base/dist-newstyle/src/cardano-b_-c8db9876882556ed \\\n\t\tinput-output-hk:cardano-crypto:f73079303f663e028288f9f4a9e08bcca39a923e:cardano_crypto/dist-newstyle/src/cardano-c_-253fd88117badd8f \\\n\t\t[...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1210
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It might be useful to separate the `GH_TUPLE` items coming from `make-use-"
"cabal` from the other ones to make it easy to update the port:"
msgstr "可以将 `make-use-cabal` 生成的 `GH_TUPLE` 项与其他项分开，以便于更新 port："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1216
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GH_TUPLE=\tinput-output-hk:cardano-base:0f3a867493059e650cda69e20a5cbf1ace289a57:cardano_base/dist-newstyle/src/cardano-b_-c8db9876882556ed \\\n"
"\t\tinput-output-hk:cardano-crypto:f73079303f663e028288f9f4a9e08bcca39a923e:cardano_crypto/dist-newstyle/src/cardano-c_-253fd88117badd8f \\\n"
"\t\t[...]\n"
msgstr "GH_TUPLE=\tinput-output-hk:cardano-base:0f3a867493059e650cda69e20a5cbf1ace289a57:cardano_base/dist-newstyle/src/cardano-b_-c8db9876882556ed \\\n\t\tinput-output-hk:cardano-crypto:f73079303f663e028288f9f4a9e08bcca39a923e:cardano_crypto/dist-newstyle/src/cardano-c_-253fd88117badd8f \\\n\t\t[...]\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1218
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "GH_TUPLE+=\tbitcoin-core:secp256k1:ac83be33d0956faf6b7f61a60ab524ef7d6a473a:secp\n"
msgstr "GH_TUPLE+=\tbitcoin-core:secp256k1:ac83be33d0956faf6b7f61a60ab524ef7d6a473a:secp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1221
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Haskell ports with VCS dependencies also require the following hack for the "
"time being:"
msgstr "目前，含有 VCS 依赖项的 Haskell port 还需要使用以下变通方法："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1225
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "BINARY_ALIAS=\tgit=true\n"
msgstr "BINARY_ALIAS=\tgit=true\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1230
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using GNU Autotools"
msgstr "使用 GNU Autotools"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1234
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If a port needs any of the GNU Autotools software, add `USES=autoreconf`.  "
"See crossref:uses[uses-autoreconf,`autoreconf`] for more information."
msgstr "如果 port 需要任何 GNU Autotools 软件，请添加 `USES=autoreconf`。有关更多信息，请参阅 crossref:uses[uses-autoreconf,`autoreconf`]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1236
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using GNU `gettext`"
msgstr "使用 GNU `gettext`"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1239
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr "基本用法"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1243
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the port requires `gettext`, set `USES= gettext`, and the port will "
"inherit a dependency on [.filename]#libintl.so# from package:devel/"
"gettext[].  Other values for `gettext` usage are listed in crossref:"
"uses[uses-gettext,`USES=gettext`]."
msgstr "如果 port 需要 `gettext`，请设置 `USES= gettext`，port 将继承对 package:devel/gettext[] 提供的 [.filename]#libintl.so# 的依赖。`gettext` 用法的其他取值请参阅 crossref:uses[uses-gettext,`USES=gettext`]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1246
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A rather common case is a port using `gettext` and `configure`.  Generally, "
"GNU `configure` should be able to locate `gettext` automatically."
msgstr "一种相当常见的情况是 port 使用 `gettext` 和 `configure`。通常，GNU `configure` 应能自动找到 `gettext`。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1251
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USES=\tgettext\n"
"GNU_CONFIGURE=\tyes\n"
msgstr "USES=\tgettext\nGNU_CONFIGURE=\tyes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1254
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If it ever fails to, hints at the location of `gettext` can be passed in "
"`CPPFLAGS` and `LDFLAGS` using `localbase` as follows:"
msgstr "如果无法自动找到，可以使用 `localbase`，按如下方式通过 `CPPFLAGS` 和 `LDFLAGS` 提供 `gettext` 的位置提示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1259
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USES=\tgettext localbase:ldflags\n"
"GNU_CONFIGURE=\tyes\n"
msgstr "USES=\tgettext localbase:ldflags\nGNU_CONFIGURE=\tyes\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1262
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Optional Usage"
msgstr "可选用法"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1268
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some software products allow for disabling NLS.  For example, through "
"passing `--disable-nls` to `configure`.  In that case, the port must use "
"`gettext` conditionally, depending on the status of the `NLS` option.  For "
"ports of low to medium complexity, use this idiom:"
msgstr "有些软件允许禁用 NLS，例如向 `configure` 传递 `--disable-nls`。在这种情况下，port 必须根据 `NLS` 选项的状态有条件地使用 `gettext`。对于复杂度较低或中等的 port，可采用以下惯用写法："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1272
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1287
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "GNU_CONFIGURE=\t\tyes\n"
msgstr "GNU_CONFIGURE=\t\tyes\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1275
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"OPTIONS_DEFINE=\t\tNLS\n"
"OPTIONS_SUB=\t\tyes\n"
msgstr "OPTIONS_DEFINE=\t\tNLS\nOPTIONS_SUB=\t\tyes\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1278
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"NLS_USES=\t\tgettext\n"
"NLS_CONFIGURE_ENABLE=\tnls\n"
msgstr "NLS_USES=\t\tgettext\nNLS_CONFIGURE_ENABLE=\tnls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1283
#, fuzzy
msgid "Or using the older way of using options:"
msgstr "也可以使用较旧的选项写法："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1289
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "OPTIONS_DEFINE=\t\tNLS\n"
msgstr "OPTIONS_DEFINE=\t\tNLS\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1291
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ".include <bsd.port.options.mk>\n"
msgstr ".include <bsd.port.options.mk>\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1299
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
".if ${PORT_OPTIONS:MNLS}\n"
"USES+=\t\t\tgettext\n"
"PLIST_SUB+=\t\tNLS=\"\"\n"
".else\n"
"CONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--disable-nls\n"
"PLIST_SUB+=\t\tNLS=\"@comment \"\n"
".endif\n"
msgstr ".if ${PORT_OPTIONS:MNLS}\nUSES+=\t\t\tgettext\nPLIST_SUB+=\t\tNLS=\"\"\n.else\nCONFIGURE_ARGS+=\t--disable-nls\nPLIST_SUB+=\t\tNLS=\"@comment \"\n.endif\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1310
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The next item on the to-do list is to arrange so that the message catalog "
"files are included in the packing list conditionally.  The [."
"filename]#Makefile# part of this task is already provided by the idiom.  It "
"is explained in the section on crossref:plist[plist-sub,advanced [."
"filename]#pkg-plist# practices].  In a nutshell, each occurrence of `%%NLS%"
"%` in [.filename]#pkg-plist# will be replaced by \"`@comment `\" if NLS is "
"disabled, or by a null string if NLS is enabled.  Consequently, the lines "
"prefixed by `%%NLS%%` will become mere comments in the final packing list if "
"NLS is off; otherwise the prefix will be just left out. Then insert `%%NLS%"
"%` before each path to a message catalog file in [.filename]#pkg-plist#.  "
"For example:"
msgstr "待办列表中的下一项是根据条件将消息目录文件加入打包清单。此任务中 [.filename]#Makefile# 部分已经由该惯用写法提供。相关说明见 crossref:plist[plist-sub,高级 [.filename]#pkg-plist# 实践] 一节。简而言之，如果禁用了 NLS， [.filename]#pkg-plist# 中每个 `%%NLS%%` 都会替换为 \"`@comment `\"；如果启用了 NLS，则替换为空字符串。因此，若 NLS 关闭，最终打包清单中以 `%%NLS%%` 为前缀的行将成为注释；否则只会去掉该前缀。然后，在 [.filename]#pkg-plist# 中每个消息目录文件路径前加上 `%%NLS%%`。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1315
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"%%NLS%%share/locale/fr/LC_MESSAGES/foobar.mo\n"
"%%NLS%%share/locale/no/LC_MESSAGES/foobar.mo\n"
msgstr "%%NLS%%share/locale/fr/LC_MESSAGES/foobar.mo\n%%NLS%%share/locale/no/LC_MESSAGES/foobar.mo\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1318
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In high complexity cases, more advanced techniques may be needed, such as "
"crossref:plist[plist-dynamic,dynamic packing list generation]."
msgstr "对于复杂度较高的情况，可能需要采用更高级的技术，例如 crossref:plist[plist-dynamic,动态生成打包清单]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1320
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Handling Message Catalog Directories"
msgstr "处理消息目录"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1327
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There is a point to note about installing message catalog files.  The target "
"directories for them, which reside under [.filename]#LOCALBASE/share/"
"locale#, must not be created and removed by a port.  The most popular "
"languages have their respective directories listed in [.filename]#PORTSDIR/"
"Templates/BSD.local.dist#.  The directories for many other languages are "
"governed by the package:devel/gettext[] port.  Consult its [.filename]#pkg-"
"plist# and see whether the port is going to install a message catalog file "
"for a unique language."
msgstr "安装消息目录文件时需要注意一点。它们的目标目录位于 [.filename]#LOCALBASE/share/locale# 下，port 不得创建或删除这些目录。最常用语言对应的目录已列在 [.filename]#PORTSDIR/Templates/BSD.local.dist# 中。许多其他语言的目录由 package:devel/gettext[] port 管理。请查阅其 [.filename]#pkg-plist#，确认该 port 是否会为某种独有语言安装消息目录文件。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1329
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using Perl"
msgstr "使用 Perl"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1337
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If `MASTER_SITES` is set to `CPAN`, the correct subdirectory is usually "
"selected automatically.  If the default subdirectory is wrong, `CPAN/Module` "
"can be used to change it.  `MASTER_SITES` can also be set to the old "
"`MASTER_SITE_PERL_CPAN`, then the preferred value of `MASTER_SITE_SUBDIR` is "
"the top-level hierarchy name.  For example, the recommended value for `p5-"
"Module-Name` is `Module`.  The top-level hierarchy can be examined at "
"https://cpan.org/modules/by-module/[cpan.org].  This keeps the port working "
"when the author of the module changes."
msgstr "如果将 `MASTER_SITES` 设置为 `CPAN`，通常会自动选择正确的子目录。如果默认子目录不正确，可以使用 `CPAN/Module` 更改它。也可以将 `MASTER_SITES` 设置为旧的 `MASTER_SITE_PERL_CPAN`，此时 `MASTER_SITE_SUBDIR` 的首选值是顶级层次结构名称。例如，`p5-Module-Name` 的推荐值是 `Module`。可以在 link:https://cpan.org/modules/by-module/[cpan.org] 查看顶级层次结构。这样，当模块作者发生变化时，port 仍能正常工作。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1342
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The exception to this rule is when the relevant directory does not exist or "
"the distfile does not exist in that directory.  In such case, using author's "
"id as `MASTER_SITE_SUBDIR` is allowed.  The `CPAN:AUTHOR` macro can be used, "
"which will be translated to the hashed author directory.  For example, `CPAN:"
"AUTHOR` will be converted to `authors/id/A/AU/AUTHOR`."
msgstr "例外情况是相关目录不存在，或 distfile 不在该目录中。在这种情况下，允许使用作者 ID 作为 `MASTER_SITE_SUBDIR`。可以使用 `CPAN:AUTHOR` 宏，它会转换为经过哈希处理的作者目录。例如，`CPAN:AUTHOR` 会转换为 `authors/id/A/AU/AUTHOR`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1344
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When a port needs Perl support, it must set `USES=perl5` with the optional "
"`USE_PERL5` described in crossref:uses[uses-perl5,the perl5 USES "
"description]."
msgstr "需要 Perl 支持时，port 必须设置 `USES=perl5`，并可使用 crossref:uses[uses-perl5,perl5 USES 说明] 中描述的可选 `USE_PERL5`。"

#. type: Block title
