msgstr "GNOME 组件"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/special/_index.adoc:1739
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For further help with a GNOME port, look at some of the link:https://ports."
"FreeBSD.org[existing ports] for examples.  The link:https://www.FreeBSD.org/"
"gnome/[FreeBSD GNOME page] has contact information if more help is needed.  "
"The components are divided into GNOME components that are currently in use "
"and legacy components.  If the component supports argument, they are listed "
"between parenthesis in the description.  The first is the default.  \"Both\" "
"is shown if the component defaults to adding to both build and run "
"dependencies."
msgstr "如需 GNOME port 方面的进一步帮助，请查看一些[现有 ports](link:https://ports.FreeBSD.org[]) 作为示例。如需更多帮助，请访问 link:https://www.FreeBSD.org/gnome/[FreeBSD GNOME 页面]获取联系信息。组件分为当前使用的 GNOME 组件和旧版组件。如果组件支持参数，说明中会在括号内列出这些参数，第一个是默认值。如果组件默认同时添加到构建和运行依赖项中，则会标注为“两者”。"

